        {
          "name": "Crear reglamento (futbol)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('rulesetId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Organization-Id",
                "value": "{{organizationId}}"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Las metricas que deciden el marcador (goal, own_goal) no se pueden omitir. Los desempates disponibles son head_to_head, score_difference, score_for, score_against y wins; el orden importa.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sportCode\": \"football\",\n  \"name\": \"Liga mayor 2026\",\n  \"config\": {\n    \"periods\": { \"count\": 2, \"label\": \"tiempo\", \"minutes\": 45 },\n    \"points\": { \"win\": 3, \"draw\": 1, \"loss\": 0 },\n    \"tiebreakers\": [\"score_difference\", \"score_for\", \"head_to_head\"],\n    \"walkover\": { \"winnerScore\": 3, \"loserScore\": 0 },\n    \"metrics\": [\"goal\", \"own_goal\", \"assist\", \"yellow_card\", \"red_card\"]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rulesets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "rulesets"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear reglamento (voleibol)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Organization-Id",
                "value": "{{organizationId}}"
              }
            ],
            "description": "En un deporte por sets los resultados se cotizan por marcador de sets, no por victoria y empate. Con 5 sets se gana en 3, y hay que darle valor a los seis resultados posibles. El numero de sets tiene que ser impar.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sportCode\": \"volleyball\",\n  \"name\": \"Voley femenino 2026\",\n  \"config\": {\n    \"periods\": { \"count\": 5, \"label\": \"set\" },\n    \"points\": {\n      \"win_3_0\": 3,\n      \"win_3_1\": 3,\n      \"win_3_2\": 2,\n      \"loss_2_3\": 1,\n      \"loss_1_3\": 0,\n      \"loss_0_3\": 0\n    },\n    \"tiebreakers\": [\"wins\", \"score_difference\"],\n    \"walkover\": { \"winnerScore\": 3, \"loserScore\": 0 }\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rulesets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "rulesets"
              ]
            }
          },
